```

**Step 5** — Click **"Commit changes"**

Vercel will **auto-redeploy in ~30 seconds** and your site will load correctly.

---

**Why this happens:** Vercel is built for React/Next.js apps by default. When you deploy a plain HTML file, it can't find the entry point unless you tell it where to look via `vercel.json`.

